        "id": 78377,
        "name": "Envisioner",
        "username": "Envisioner",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-01T02:41:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ronway\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/48/1856_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ronway:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Have you been using your official promos yet? Feel the awesomeness they hold? You know you want Greatest Legacy and GI Bunker's promos as well.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I, on the other hand, own no promos, so if I get them they will be my first.&nbsp; And while I really want Young Legacy, I'm almost certain to find Grandpa preferable to the original version.</p>",
